<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB starts Air Liquide.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB starts Air Liquide.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>French chemicals group Air Liquide was rated &quot;buy&quot; as CS First Boston started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Analysts at CSFB said Air Liquide &quot;appears to be on the verge of shifting into an aggressive growth phase, having spent heavily in recent years on industrial investments.&quot;</p>
<p>They said attractive earnings growth resulting from those investments &quot;deserve to restore the company's historical premium rating.&quot;</p>
<p>The stock was unchanged at 972 francs by 0826 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
